{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UJeti9hSZZzvvxwJeoP8of","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news today November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nI ran one search, and it didn't turn up a clearly dated list of November 10, 2026 stories. The results are a mix of front pages with different timestamps, so treat the items below as recent rather than confirmed for today.\n\n- **Stock market:** Taipei Times reported on November 6 that the government told its financial regulator to stabilize the market, after a sell-off hit the tech-heavy index. Taiwan today ordered the financial regulator to \"stabilize\" the stock market, as the nation's tech-heavy index was caught up in a massive sell-off hitting global markets.\n- **Nvidia probe:** A November 9 Taipei Times item says an Nvidia investigation into CEO Jensen Huang is unlikely to hurt Taiwan's AI supply chain much, according to a think-tank president. An investigation launched by Nvidia into its founder and CEO Jensen Huang (黃仁勳) over his affair with an alleged Chinese spy is unlikely to have a major impact on Taiwan's artificial intelligence (AI) supply chain.\n- **Legislator indicted:** Prosecutors indicted legislator May Chin and three aides on November 6 over alleged Chinese-linked organization-building. The High Prosecutors' Office today indicted independent Legislator May Chin (高金素梅) and three of her aides on suspicion of receiving Chinese funding to develop organizations in Taiwan.\n- **Military and defense:** Focus Taiwan's current headlines include second batch of F-16V jets arrives in Taiwan and Taiwan military stages live-fire drill in Kinmen.\n- **Diplomacy:** Taiwan is closing its office in Papua New Guinea, according to Taipei Times headlines.\n- **Other:** Taiwan News carries a magnitude 4.2 earthquake jolts central Taiwan headline, and Focus Taiwan lists Taiwan wins 48 golds at Asian Sport Stacking Championships.\n\nFor the freshest coverage, check Focus Taiwan (focustaiwan.tw) and Taiwan News directly, since the cached pages here are not all from today.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"acef4cc0-d06a-4291-a7e2-c1ee5e97fbb7","uuid":"a0795d08-2283-4d7f-9e0a-3e7d1b626efa","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:58:24.569Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Taiwan news today November 10 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AW7kypSiTJH7juYVyiZWAw","content":[{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News"},{"title":"Front Page - Taipei Times","url":"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front"},{"title":"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World","url":"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/"},{"title":"Taiwan Journal","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal"},{"title":"TVBS News","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News"},{"title":"Taiwan Daily","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily"},{"title":"TaiwanPlus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus"},{"title":"Taiwan News","url":"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan"},{"title":"Focus Taiwan - CNA En